[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m succeeded in 0ms:\u001b[0m\r\n# Bounded independent release-notes trial\r\n\r\nAn independent evaluator read the installed weekly-release-notes SKILL.md and followed it on synthetic PR metadata. No installed skill files, live repository, forge, or external service was changed. Input exports explicitly replace live git/forge retrieval. The fixture scope is main, America/Chicago, [2026-10-30T00:00:00-05:00, 2026-11-06T09:00:00-06:00), release date 2026-11-06. This intentionally spans the local daylight-saving transition.\r\n\r\nThe evaluator selected PR dispositions, wrote customer wording, and materialized the chosen artifacts through apply_trial.py. This script records evaluator actions; it is not a reusable skill execution engine. The rerun consisted of inspecting the same ledger and existing dated section, finding every eligible line once, and making no destination write. first-run.md and second-run.md preserve the observed identical artifacts.\r\n\r\n## Observed results\r\n\r\n- Mixed input: 12 raw records, 11 distinct PRs"]
