[0.000, "o", "r-visible changes this week.” result, and prior notes preserved.\r\n\r\ncheck_trial.py ran successfully: **10 checks passed, zero failed**. checks.json contains each result; case directories preserve raw inputs, before/after artifacts, ledgers, and diffs. No behavioral defect was observed in these bounded cases.\r\n\r\n## Limits\r\n\r\nThis validates the evaluator's execution of the skill on supplied complete or explicitly incomplete metadata, plus the saved artifacts and rerun inspection. It does not validate live git/forge retrieval, default-branch resolution, natural-language date parsing, automatic skill discovery, independently automated repeat execution, or performance relative to a baseline. No baseline, timing, token, or superiority claims are made. Structural validation is owned by the authoring agent and is separate from this trial.\r\n\r\n"]
